# CogniShield - Git Ignore Configuration
# Prevents slides, raw drafts, agent bundles, and local scratch files from cluttering GitHub

# Local directory (contains all PPTs, slides, scripts, and agent skill packages)
local/
.tmp/

# Internal AI scaffolding files (not part of public project)
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# Slide and presentation files
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
slide_*.png

# Environment and sensitive keys
.env
*.local.js
credentials.json
token.json

# System & OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
